{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_franka_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_franka_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "駐足",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_franka_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "920bf3bac368bc45c83a11222e1688905d84c0e89db337ba44f85828fe425da4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "香草，你在這裡做什麼，這裡不是……潔西卡的宿舍嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "啊，芙蘭卡前輩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "是的，我在幫潔西卡收拾房間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……也是，我們勇敢的大小姐去了拓荒地，往後的日子就不能經常待在本艦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "嗯，我和潔西卡說好了，我幫忙收拾她的房間，再幫她把東西寄過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "需要我幫忙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "不用，我去工程部借了一些裝置，這點事情，我一個人就足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那個過自動門都會撞到的小姑娘，如今也成長了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "芙蘭卡前輩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "你覺得，潔西卡錯了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是她讓你來問的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "真是的，明明做出了那種決定，卻還是擔心前輩對她的看法……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "也不知道她是不是真的長進了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "……我覺得潔西卡很厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "她願意拋下自己的那些東西……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "呵呵，不用急著幫她說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "潔西卡有不少問題，但她總是知道自己在做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我從一開始就知道，她不是需要擔心的那種人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "只是我沒想到，她做出決定的時間——會這麼早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "早……嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是啊，她才二十歲出頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "她還有許多時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "唔……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "但是，這也不是壞事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "比起那些無法做出決定的人，潔西卡已經比他們強太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "對不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "我也一直在思考自己的未來，但是一直無法做出決定，所以……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "噗……不，我不是在說你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你也還很年輕，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我說的是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……我說的是誰呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "那我就去找信使寄東西了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "任務？我知道了，我馬上就到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在任務結束之後，找一些消遣，然後等待下一個任務。\n這並沒有什麼問題。\n她這麼想著，正打算離開房間，一個聲音卻讓她停下了腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "是的，我的意願沒有改變。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我的願望依然是創立一家屬於我自己的保全公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "克里夫先生想要和我談談？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我明白，明天我會啟程返回總部一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你說芙蘭卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "放到往常，她會毫不在意地走到自己的搭檔面前對她擠眉弄眼。\n要是她的心情再好一些，說不定還會做一些好玩的惡作劇。\n但是今天——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "她知道我的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我會和她討論這件事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……我在躲什麼呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "芙蘭卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你來得正好，我要回總部一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "哦？發生了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我和你提過的，我打算去和克里夫先生聊聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你終於下定決心了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "嗯，潔西卡那麼勇敢，我覺得……我也應該再勇敢一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "勇敢不代表無謀，你真的覺得自己已經準備好面對那個“橋夾”了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "要是你覺得應付不來，我陪你去也可以哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……不，我總得習慣這種事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你這種心直口快的性格，對上那個陰險的老傢伙，可是會被吃得死死的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "芙蘭卡，你今天心情不好，對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這和我有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "整天應付你，我覺得，我還是鍛鍊了一些看人的本事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "哇哦，我們的優等生小姐也長大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "芙蘭卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "等我回來，我想和你聊聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "認真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "認真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我大概要去一個月，回見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "好吧，看來我的心情確實有點糟糕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "匯報情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "和前期情報一致，這群盜匪綁架了運輸站的工作人員，並且佔領了那裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "他們的人數不少，裝備也不差，但是戒備不算森嚴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我已經摸清了建築的結構和他們安插的點位，現在發送給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "收到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "唉，我原本還在好奇，你和雷蛇這樣的精英被派去醫藥公司是不是有點大材小用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "現在我算是明白了，原來要做的事情沒有什麼變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你也可以申請去後勤部或者人事部，不用來受這個罪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "那可不行，外勤幹員的待遇比我在黑鋼時要好呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "而且，我早就想試試這種崗位了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "前線可不是好玩的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "所以我才主動申請和兩位前輩一起出任務嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "想必一定可以從優秀的前輩身上學到許多東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "戰場的知識可沒什麼好學的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你不會一輩子在戰場上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "對我而言，這些都是能賺錢的知識！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "在能賺錢的時候多賺一點，然後我就可以去做想做的事情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "想做的事情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "嘿嘿，其實我還沒想好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "但我覺得我會想到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "呵呵，年輕真好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "你也沒比我大到哪裡去吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "無論是在黑鋼，還是在羅德島，我都是你的前輩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "那您需不需要我來幫忙捶背揉肩呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "免了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "好了，我已經制定好作戰計劃了，現在發送給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "這麼快？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "嗚哇，好詳細！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "讓你別小看前輩的實力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我倒是從來沒有小看過您老人家就是了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "分兩隊，A隊負責正面牽制，B隊負責救援人質。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "正面牽制的人數會不會太少了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "根據之前的情報，他們的頭目很警覺，人數多的話，他們很有可能選擇逃跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "讓他們逃進山裡就麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "可是，這個A隊人數……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是不是有人囑咐過你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "“因為雷蛇不在，所以你要多關注芙蘭卡，不要讓她衝動行事。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "唔。事先聲明……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "當然不是雷蛇本人說的，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我們的優等生小姐，會直接告訴我這一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "不過也是，我們拍檔的時間，也有點太久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "久到連羅德島發布任務的時候，也總是會把我們放到一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "這難道不是好事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你覺得這是好事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "嗯——身邊有個好伙伴總是讓人放心的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "芙蘭卡會在戰場上因為尋求刺激而採取一些危險的行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "而雷蛇出於安全考量，會用各種方式制止她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "雖然她們經常鬥嘴，但作戰時合作無間，總是能夠出色地完成任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我在黑鋼時，就已經聽說過你們二人組了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我和她都已經習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃爾珀女性嘆了口氣。\n在進入黑鋼的時候，大部分人都會選擇一把制式武器。\n她雖然挑了一把制式短刺劍防身，但依然堅持使用自己的迅捷劍作為主要武器。\n時間久了，許多人都以為她只會使用那把迅捷劍。\n但實際上，她的短刺劍也用得很好。\n而現在，就連她自己也快忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "走吧，速戰速決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "多虧了芙蘭卡在正面牽制，我和其他隊友順利把人質救了出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "但是等我一回頭，就看到他們把芙蘭卡給堵住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "欸！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我當時心都跳到嗓子眼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "雖然對方的裝備不算多麼精良，但是，他們畢竟人多勢眾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "而且，他們意識到自己受到芙蘭卡的戲弄，一個個都恨不得剝了她的皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "但芙蘭卡卻悠哉悠哉地站在那裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我心想，完了完了，難道雷蛇不在，芙蘭卡打算放飛一下自我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "就在這時——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "就在這時？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "哼哼，這可是獨家新聞，想知道的話，可要付出一點代價。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "杏仁比了一個錢的手勢，露出奸詐的笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "……好、好吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "哎喲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "用別人的故事賺錢可不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "這叫合理利用資源！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "咦，雷蛇你回來啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你在說芙蘭卡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "讓我也聽一聽吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "好吧好吧，今天就當作是免費大放送好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "呃，這下搞得我反而有些罪惡感了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "總之，說時遲那時快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "芙蘭卡身處戰場中央，而我則剛剛運送完人質，站在塔樓上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我們並沒有制定嚴格的時間表，她應該是不知道我的位置的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "但是在那時，芙蘭卡卻精準地向我遞了一個眼神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "那個眼神引導我看向另一邊，那邊，有一座危樓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "而危樓附近，恰好是那群盜匪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "我瞬間明白了她的意思——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "她並不是因為莽撞而出現在了他們面前，她是故意引誘他們到達那個位置的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "而連我會出現在那個位置她都料到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "她可沒有那麼神通廣大，只是算算時間，你或者其他隊員也該出現了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "那要是我們因為一些狀況而沒有出現呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "她大概會去和你們會合，或許她也有第二手準備。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果是我的話，可能會在危樓上事先安置炸藥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "這麼說來，芙蘭卡確實事先問我要了一些炸藥……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "總覺得，這次任務中的芙蘭卡，和之前的感覺並不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "沉穩、可靠……雖然她平時也很可靠，但是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "她人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "香草",
      "text": "好像出任務回來後，她就把自己關在房間裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杏仁",
      "text": "是啊，我還想找她慶祝一下呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……我去找她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "杏仁那個多嘴的傢伙，現在大概在到處說吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "唉，算了，隨她去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "桌邊，母親寄來的那封信依然完好地放在那裡。\n她會準時地給母親寄錢，也會熱情地回覆母親的每一個問題，她很愛自己的母親。\n但是有兩個問題她始終避而不談——\n你想要從事傭兵這麼危險的職業到什麼時候？\n你什麼時候回家？\n這兩個問題其實是一個問題。\n她相信母親只是出於單純的母愛才如此反覆地提示，但對她而言，這兩個問題蘊含的意義比任何人想像的都要重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃爾珀女性打開從可頌那裡買來的二手唱片機，而後，將自己砸入柔軟的床裡。\n像是想要投入一個沒有人認識自己的深淵。\n她從不認為自己沒有做好準備。\n她認為自己在享受當下的每一分每一秒。\n但是，當潔西卡決定前往拓荒地，當雷蛇決定成立自己的保全公司時，她感到了一種失落。\n這種失落並非對未來的迷茫，她不是不知道自己該何去何從。\n而是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有節奏且有禮貌的敲門聲，她知道是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "她知道我在房間裡，所以她會找到我藏備用鑰匙的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "對，就是門邊的花盆下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "然後，她就會毫不猶豫地打開門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "唉，下次我還是換一個放鑰匙的地方吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "芙蘭卡，這可不像你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "怎麼樣才算像我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……至少不是現在這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "優等生小姐，現在有空嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果我沒有空，就不會來找你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我們是不是有一段時間沒有對練過了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "所以說，你還是一本正經地把你的理想全部說了一遍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "畢竟除此之外，我不知道別的做法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "好吧，比起逼你說一些冠冕堂皇的話，這樣確實更加適合你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那麼，結果如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "不怎麼樣，克里夫先生並不看好我的選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "但是，他也說，他並不介意多一個偏遠的合作伙伴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "婉轉的說法——保全公司之間沒有真正的合作可言，一旦你脫離了黑鋼，你和黑鋼就不可能是朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人一邊聊著，一邊走向訓練場的兩端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你應該聽羅拉說了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我大概能理解為什麼你會忽然找我對練。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "今天我會奉陪到你滿意為止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "優等生小姐，你最近是不是有點太得意忘形了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我是故意這麼說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "劍刃與盾牌碰撞，發出激烈的聲響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "對了，我還去見了幾個從訓練生時期一直保持聯絡的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "他們有不少人願意跟我一起出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "原來你是回去參加“同學會”的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "算不上，只是和他們聚了聚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "他們都提到了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "畢竟，雖然你總是喊我“優等生”，但每次都拿第一、所有同屆受訓兵印象裡最優秀的人是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "對一個戰士來說，“優等生”可不是什麼讚美之詞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "而我呢，我從第一眼看到你，就看你不順眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我還記得我們兩個第一次在模擬訓練時對上的情景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我當時是怎麼說的來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你說，“讓我看看優等生在實戰裡是不是也是優等生吧”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你從那天起就開始叫我“優等生”了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這麼記仇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你可以從現在開始放棄叫我這個綽號。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那可不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人對於對方的招式都無比熟悉，兵器碰撞聲一時間填滿了整個房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "畢竟，像你這樣既不是野心家，又不是軍火販子的人，來當僱傭兵，實在是個怪胎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "直到今天，我也還是這麼想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我可不想被嘴上說著因為尋求刺激而成為僱傭兵的人評頭論足啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "變得越來越會說話了嘛，優等生小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "多虧你教得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "剛才進房間的時候，我看到了那封信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你這幾年一直沒有回去過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "畢竟，我不知道見面的話應該和她說些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我記得你和你母親的關係並不差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "何止不差，我很愛我的母親，她也很愛我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "她鼓勵我去做自己想做的事，也不會強迫我做任何不想做的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我的性格呢，其實就是被她這樣慣出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "看得出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "僅從性格而言，僱傭兵裡和我類似的人有很多……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "但是像你這樣，能夠在戰鬥中汲取樂趣，比起迴避危險，更樂於享受的反而是少數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我也是花了很長時間才能理解這件事的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "因為你沒有後顧之憂，所以你反而可以成為這樣的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是啊，我真該給你看看我小時候的照片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "不是我自誇，但你可能不會見到比那時的我更加像富家小姐的孩子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "呃，還是算了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "呿，就算你想看，我也不知道還有沒有……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "好吧，媽媽肯定還保存著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "唉，反正，我越是享受著我手中的一切，就越是害怕見到她——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我不應該遠行的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我應該陪在她的身邊，開一家小店，收入能夠應付生活支出就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "但我卻無法克制自己對……這一切的嚮往。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "芙蘭卡指了指手中的劍，而後轉身看了一圈這座規模並不小的訓練場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "在做自由傭兵的時期，她已經很擔心我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "在我準備出發的那一天，她笑著把我送上了開往黑鋼訓練營的車。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "但我知道，等車開遠了，她一定會哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你怕見到她，你會無法離開嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我怕我會不由自主地和她爭吵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "明明我很愛她，明明她很愛我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……原本我以為你只是心情不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "看來，你的心情是很不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "這麼多年下來，這是你第一次說這麼多話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是啊，從來都是你在那裡說，我負責嘲笑你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "等等，難道你的病情惡化了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "放心吧，我的病情沒什麼大礙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "不會變好，也沒有變得更糟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我已經開始習慣洗澡時摸到那些結晶的觸感了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "也許是我瘋了，誰知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我並不認為人一定要擁有遠大的理想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "對我而言，從戰鬥中感受到自己一步一步的成長，從捉弄身邊的人那裡獲得一點微不足道的趣味——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我覺得已經足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "從黑鋼到羅德島，大部分時候我都過得很愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我覺得，我是能夠一直這樣下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "直到潔西卡，直到你，你們都做出了自己的選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我才發現，其實並不是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我不由自主地問自己——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那我該何去何從呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "芙蘭卡，你總是能把所有事情做好，你是許多人憧憬的對象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "也包括我在內。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……等等，你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那個第一次出任務就在戰場上把我攔下來的傢伙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "這和以我的標準判斷你的作戰風格太過危險，並不衝突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "一直以來，我都不太清楚我為什麼會和你成為搭檔，但是最近我逐漸想明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "無論你是怎麼想的，但我一直想要知道……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "像你這樣和我完全不同的人，究竟是怎麼看待人生的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "或許是直覺告訴我，我會從你身上學到許多東西吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我可不覺得你有從我身上學到什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "很多東西，戰鬥技巧、語言藝術，還有一點……樂觀的心態？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "當然，這些與其說是學到的，不如說是為了跟上你的腳步而磨練自己得來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "就像你和羅拉一起出的那次任務……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你是芙蘭卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你看起來需要一個支撐，但你並不是真的需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你需要的只是有人推你一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這算是某種決裂宣言？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我只是想告訴你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你不用太顧慮我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我現在發現，你真的越來越擅長讓我生氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "多虧你教得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鋁熱劍脫手而出，在空中劃過一道危險的弧線，而閃光盾也從瓦伊凡的手中不受控制地滑落。\n平局，一如既往。\n但芙蘭卡並沒有像往常一樣，一邊開雷蛇的玩笑，一邊過去撿起武器。\n她呆立在原地，像是在思考些什麼。\n而雷蛇彷彿也是在等待著她一樣。\n片刻後，她終於開口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你說想和我聊一聊的事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是邀請我去你未來想要成立的保全公司，是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我不會去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "暫時不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷蛇撿起鋁熱劍，芙蘭卡撿起閃光盾，然後，互相丟給對方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我的病情已經差不多穩定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我打算請個長假，先回家看看媽媽，陪陪她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "或許會和她吵一架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "然後……或許我會出個遠門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "接一點長期外派的任務什麼的，去遠一點的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "或許等我回來的時候，你的新公司已經成立了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "到時候我可以請你來坐坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你也別高興得太早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "當初，是你擅自跟著我來到羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "說不定哪天，我在羅德島待不下去了，就會死皮賴臉地去你的公司賴著了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "比起人情，我更看重規矩，你知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那我到時候只好在你公司樓下立個牌子再打個地舖，再在上面寫一些你的糗事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……唉，我怎麼會認識你這種人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "是啊，你怎麼會認識我這種人，真為你感到遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "中午吃點什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "誰請客？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "行吧，今天我請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
